  "description": "After being reborn into a novel, Shuryna, knowing her ultimate fate, plans to become a magic knight and retire rich. However, her biggest obstacle is the four men in love with her best friend, Hestia. They're supposed to chase after Hestia but want Shuryna to be their matchmaker. She refuses since that role was what led to her banishment, but the boys are relentless. Can Shuryna grasp the wealthy retirement she desperately desires? Or will Hestia's love interests lead to her downfall again? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
